#: ../../providers.md:45
msgid "An explicit endpoint suffix also selects the matching protocol while preserving the SDK base URL. For example, a URL ending in `/responses` resolves to `responses`; setting `api` explicitly takes precedence."
msgstr "显式 endpoint 后缀也会选择对应协议，同时保留 SDK base URL。例如，以 `/responses` 结尾的 URL 会解析为 `responses`；显式设置的 `api` 优先级更高。"

#: ../../providers.md:49
msgid "Responses requests use `store = false`. minacode keeps the returned reasoning and function-call items in its own transcript and replays them on later requests, so tool loops and resumed sessions remain stateless. See OpenAI's [Responses migration guide](https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/guides/migrate-to-responses)."
msgstr "Responses 请求使用 `store = false`。minacode 在自己的 transcript 中保存返回的 reasoning 和 function-call item，并在后续请求中回放，因此工具循环和恢复后的 session 都能保持无状态。参见 OpenAI 的 [Responses 迁移指南](https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/guides/migrate-to-responses)。"

#: ../../providers.md:53
msgid "Reasoning"
msgstr "Reasoning"

#: ../../providers.md:55
msgid "`reasoning` is minacode's provider-independent effort setting. Change it live with `/reason [EFFORT]`. Native Responses and Anthropic requests receive their standard reasoning fields; Chat-compatible providers receive the documented form selected by `chat_reasoning`."
msgstr "`reasoning` 是 minacode 与 provider 无关的 effort 设置，可以通过 `/reason [EFFORT]` 实时修改。原生 Responses 和 Anthropic 请求使用各自的标准 reasoning 字段；Chat-compatible provider 使用 `chat_reasoning` 选择的文档格式。"

#: ../../providers.md:59
msgid "Leave `chat_reasoning = \"auto\"` unless an otherwise unknown provider needs a specific wire format. Supported explicit formats are `off`, `reasoning`, `reasoning_effort`, `thinking`, and `enable_thinking`. A compatibility profile may also suppress `temperature` where a provider's thinking mode fixes or rejects it."
msgstr "除非未知 provider 需要特定 wire format，否则保持 `chat_reasoning = \"auto\"`。可显式选择 `off`、`reasoning`、`reasoning_effort`、`thinking` 和 `enable_thinking`。如果 provider 的 thinking mode 固定或拒绝 temperature，兼容性 profile 也可能省略 `temperature`。"

#: ../../providers.md:64
msgid "Caching and strict tools"
msgstr "缓存与 strict tools"

#: ../../providers.md:66
msgid "`prompt_cache_key = \"auto\"` creates a stable key from the workspace, host, model, protocol, and tool set. Providers that cache automatically can disable this through their compatibility profile. `/status` reports the cache-token counts returned by the provider; it does not estimate cache hits locally."
msgstr "`prompt_cache_key = \"auto\"` 根据 workspace、host、model、protocol 和工具集合生成稳定 key。自动缓存的 provider 可以通过兼容性 profile 禁用该字段。`/status` 展示 provider 返回的缓存 token 数；minacode 不会在本地估算缓存命中。"

#: ../../providers.md:71
msgid "`strict_tools = true` only becomes active for a host and protocol known to support strict function schemas. `/strict` reports whether the setting is active. On other providers the normal schemas remain unchanged."
msgstr "只有 host 和协议已知支持 strict function schema 时，`strict_tools = true` 才会生效。`/strict` 会报告该设置是否处于 active 状态。其他 provider 仍使用普通 schema。"

#: ../../providers.md:75
msgid "Compatibility profiles"
msgstr "兼容性 profile"

#: ../../providers.md:77
msgid "Profiles are domain-wide where the provider contract is domain-wide, and model-family rules are used only when the provider documents different behavior by family."
msgstr "如果 provider contract 对整个 domain 一致，profile 就按 domain 匹配；只有 provider 明确记录不同 model family 的行为时，才使用 model-family rule。"

